 0003           ; /**************************************************************************
 0003           ; MODULE:    MCOHW
 0003           ; CONTAINS:  Preliminary, limited hardware driver implementation for
 0003           ;            the 2-Wire Controller
 0003           ;            This version re-uses functions provided by
 0003           ;            www.esacademy.com/faq/progs
 0003           ;            If you need a full-featured 8XC591 MicroCANopen driver, contact
 0003           ;            support@esacademy.com
